  "title": "Tsuda Umeko",
  "summary": "Tsuda Umeko was born in Edo in 1864 and died in 1929. She went to the United States in 1871 with the Iwakura Mission as a girl of six, returned to Japan in 1892, and in 1900 opened Joshi Eigaku Juku, the school that became Tsuda University, in Kōjimachi, Tokyo.",
